<title>UK: FedEx launches new box service from Europe /M.East.</title>
<headline>FedEx launches new box service from Europe /M.East.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Express Corp said it has launched its FedEx 25kg box and FedEx 10kg box flat-rate product from Europe and the Middle East.</p>
<p>FedEx boxes are customs cleared, door-to-door and time definitie services with delivery commitments from one to three days and can be shipped to 211 countries, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The boxes will be available to customers across ten European countries. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
